 Out with Boys and Fellow Models</strong><br>Work together, go out, and become closer with boys and fellow models! Capture fun memories by taking videos and photos together, then share them on social media. You can even style the boys and your fellow models!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/extras/79017baf3bd9de0fcebf2ea146aefdd5.poster.avif?t=1787754986\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/extras/79017baf3bd9de0fcebf2ea146aefdd5.webm?t=1787754986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/extras/79017baf3bd9de0fcebf2ea146aefdd5.mp4?t=1787754986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The latest entry in the fashion game series, packed with tons of the newest trend items! Enjoy fashion, work, romance, and more as you aim to become the No.1 model, the “Top of nicola”!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/3aede3ff319302c619be73af6dad8ff275949c66/header.jpg?t=1787754986", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/030830bb3423be2b8d86b157c0e17e8fa75af8c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787754986", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4588140/030830bb3423be2b8d86b157c0e17e8fa75af8c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787754986", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><stron